**Copy rule.** As `RcicAnnLRG`'s, with names namespace-QUALIFIED: copied are exactly the cone
declarations whose STATEMENT (theorems) or TEXT (defs) mentions `TyKA`/`EqKA` or a declaration so
copied, transitively, a root-level `X` renamed `Xg`, a nested `N.x` keeping its short name inside
`namespace Ng` when `N` is copied and renamed `N.xg` otherwise (only `AnnEnvA.hS ↦ AnnEnvA.hSg`).
Qualification keeps a nested short name (`RecAtA.members`, `AnnEnvA.hE`) from colliding with a
field or a binder (`E.members`, `hE`). Everything else is called from main's module. Not copied
beyond that: main's two rows over `EnvWfA` (`sortConvCharA_wf`, `piConvInjA_wf`: relation-free
conclusions).

**Provenance.** The scaffold (`ea078e04bf`; 227 copied, 695 shared over 17 modules,
`RcicAnnGroup` contributing none) was generated by `scripts/rcic_gcopy_env.py` (git blob
`84edcc1f0e9624047b15b468b2f2002e590007bd`, last present at `ea078e04bf`; usage `python3
scripts/rcic_gcopy_env.py --write` writes the `*G.lean` files, `--census` prints the split
